TWLBase_syncTWLBuckets
├── when lastEpoch is equal to currentEpoch
│   └── it should revert with EPOCH_NOT_FINISHED
├── when currentEpochInflows is greater than or equal to lastEpochInflows plus growthGoal
│   └── it should increase lockEpochDuration by epochGrowthRate
├── when currentEpochInflows is less than lastEpochInflows plus growthGoal
│   └── it should decrease lockEpochDuration by epochDecayRate
├── when lockEpochDuration is greater than epochCeiling
│   └── it should cap lockEpochDuration at epochCeiling
├── when lockEpochDuration is less than epochFloor
│   └── it should floor lockEpochDuration at epochFloor
└── when bucket is disabled
    └── it should not update the bucket
